81	// ParseWithSources: an effective config value that fails type conversion
82	// yields a *ParseError wrapping ErrInvalidValue with SourceConfig, while
83	// values shadowed by a higher layer are never converted (their files
84	// must still be syntactically and structurally valid).
85	//
86	// ParseConfigFiles never reads the process environment, does not modify
